<span id="S3.SS5.fig1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S3.SS5.fig1.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Algorithm 2  BADiff Sampling
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.8pt;"></span></span>
<span id="S3.SS5.fig1.1.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_align_left ltx_listing">
<span id="algx2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
